v></section></div></div><div class="_0Q58wzIacfw-" data-test="-container" data-testid="-container" style="background-color:#ffffff"><div class="_6g8Y9IcuD3E-" data-test=""><section data-test="editorial-blurb" data-testid="editorial-blurb" class="WG-kJ5LdIoM-"><div class="VunMl8W8Iis- _0TkcbW1q-3I-"><h2 class="j2hgXypamjQ- R749zmkBlAk-">Frequently asked questions about OpenTable</h2><div class="-s3u-2ZPO7g- ukvN6yaH1Ds- l4fe3BiQil4-"><div><p data-test="editorial-paragraph-text" class="_5iw5ClC493Q-">OpenTable helps you discover the best restaurants for every occasion. Through the website and app, you can explore over 60,000 restaurants worldwide and instantly see what’s available nearby. Quickly narrow down your choices by filtering for  new restaurants, hidden culinary gems, local favorites, and more. Whether you’re looking to book top restaurants near you or MICHELIN-Starred restaurants around the world, OpenTable has you covered.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="RkEFn1r-eW0-"><header data-test="sectionHeader" class="oirK3JB9hiE- -ABy0U7vQbE- HJ5-46Qa8Yw- Co5FRE7aIFY- CiC3bkS9z-U-"><div class="_3t7xUl8oAqk-"><h2 class="_8mty8ImkgJA- HJ5-46Qa8Yw- HJ5-46Qa8Yw-">How does OpenTable work?</h2></div></header><div class="mPWhpI5sBxg-"><div class="_0uMlWE3MBnQ-" style="transform:translateX(-0%)"><div class="Ns4397SMrkU-"><img src="/static/cfe/14/images/discovery-P5MAT2JY.svg" alt="Discovery" class="em6ZoI3eFuc-"/><h3 class="g1aCM38nnsA-">Discover the perfect restaurant for any occasion</h3></div><div class="Ns4397SMrkU-"><img src="/static/cfe/14/images/reservations-ZKMUZLE4.svg" alt="Reservations" class="em6ZoI3eFuc-"/><h3 class="g1aCM38nnsA-">Easily manage your reservations</h3></div><div class="Ns4397SMrkU-"><img src="/static/cfe/14/images/notifications-XW7MPP53.svg" alt="Notifications" class="em6ZoI3eFuc-"/><h3 class="g1aCM38nnsA-">Full visibility into available reservations; timely notifications</h3></div><div class="Ns4397SMrkU-"><img src="/static/cfe/14/images/rewards-UQPGO6RU.svg" alt="Rewards" class="em6ZoI3eFuc-"/><h3 class="g1aCM38nnsA-">Earn rewards for dining out</h3></div></div><nav class="Y8wz9ezhxKE-" aria-label="Slider navigation"><button type="button" class="eOwkOp4csls- XQyTWFHZbMo-" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button type="button" class="eOwkOp4csls-" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button type="button" class="eOwkOp4csls-" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button type="button" class="eOwkOp4csls-" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button></nav></div></div><section><nav class="i0YZCrklk5g- Gbb-BhPGnf4-"><ol class="" role="tablist"><li class="_6h5Zq4fZJew-" data-test="tab-navigation-button" role="tab" aria-label="Discovery" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-tabid="discovery"><span class="KNUeZiXloxY- tiodZyr3dM8-">Discovery</span></li><li class="" data-test="tab-navigation-button" role="tab" aria-label="Reservations" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tabid="reservations"><span class="KNUeZiXloxY- tiodZyr3dM8-">Reservations</span></li><li class="" data-test="tab-navigation-button" role="tab" aria-label="Availability" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tabid="availability"><span class="KNUeZiXloxY- tiodZyr3dM8-">Availability</span></li><li class="" data-test="tab-navigation-button" role="tab" aria-label="OpenTable points" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tabid="rewards"><span class="KNUeZiXloxY- tiodZyr3dM8-">OpenTable points</span></li></ol><div class="KwWzH8AYzOY- Cab9e5IGb0g-" data-testid="tabs-overlay"></div></nav><div class="N5hZvfig6Iw-"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why should I use OpenTable to find restaurants?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"With over 60,000+ restaurants worldwide, the OpenTable website and app offer a one-stop-shop to discover and book restaurants. Search by date, time, and location to see what’s available, and then narrow down your options using filters like outdoor seating, price range or dietary restrictions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I read or leave a restaurant review on OpenTable?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! Restaurant profiles feature reviews from verified diners who have actually visited the restaurant so that you know you’re getting an accurate account. And you can join in—after you dine, you’ll be prompted to leave a review of your experience."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I cancel an OpenTable reservation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, you can easily cancel or change your reservation from your confirmation email or your OpenTable account via the website or app as long as you are within the restaurant’s cancellation window."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I add special requests to my reservation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, you can add special requests such as dietary preferences or accessibility requests when you make a reservation and select tags to let the restaurant know if you’re celebrating something special, like a birthday or an anniversary. If you think of something after you book—for example, you find out about a companion’s dietary restrictions—some restaurants have even enabled direct messaging so you can make requests directly through the OpenTable app."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I find last-minute restaurant reservations?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. OpenTable search immediately gives you full visibility into what’s available nearby at the time you select, and for those hard-to-get tables, you can set Notify Me (MacOS and Opentable.com) to receive a notification if a table becomes available on your preferred date and time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does OpenTable show real-time restaurant availability?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"OpenTable restaurant availability is always accurate and up-to-date, ensuring that your reservations are confirmed instantly."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does OpenTable offer exclusive access to certain reservations?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, some restaurants offer exclusive access, unique dining experiences, or special offers, which are available for selection when booking a reservation on OpenTable. These can include anything from guided dining experiences that pair specific seating arrangements with custom menus, to reserving a spot near the band on a Friday night."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I view full availability for a restaurant?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"To see the full availability for a restaurant on OpenTable, go to the restaurant’s profile page on the OpenTable website or app, select your desired date and time, and then choose View Full Availability to browse all available time slots displayed for your chosen party size."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I earn OpenTable points?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"First, make sure you have an OpenTable account. Once you’re signed up, you can start earning 100 points per reservation by booking select tables. Keep an eye out for bonus point tables too, which allow you to earn 1,000 points! Learn more about OpenTable dining rewards <a href=\"[object Object]\">here</a>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I redeem my points?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Head into your Diner Profile on our app or website and you will see how many points you’ve earned, plus options to redeem them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What can I get with OpenTable points?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can redeem your OpenTable points for credits towards your bill, discount off of prepaid experiences, or Amazon gift cards. The more you dine, the more you get."}}]}</script><div class="XDbCZTeuCPA-"><div><div class="RjGtnqKK63c- -r-aGIqyXPI- JA6p9Vj6e4U-" data-allow-multiple="true" data-test="opentable-faqs-item"><button id="faqItem-0-accordion-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqItem-0-accordion-body" type="button" class="cO0uBZWRVZk-"><h4 class="D1DFHmi9wDU- BQICRGEvJp4-">Why should I use OpenTable to find restaurants?</h4><span class="irNswZTgdxU- LcVggoazFpE- MRHMDv5sa38-" data-test="icDown" data-testid="icDown"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.11 11.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708l.708-.707a.5.5 0 0 1 .707 0L12 12.414l2.475-2.475a.5.5 0 0 1 .707 0l.707.707a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .707l-3.535 3.536a.498.498 0 0 1-.708 0l-3.535-3.535Z" fill="#2D333F"/></svg></span></button><div id="faqItem-0-accordion-body" aria-labelledby="faqItem-0-accordion-title" style="max-height:0px" class="saYzDT02E6A- impression-tracked" data-index="1" data-itemid="faqItem-0" data-name="Why should I use OpenTable to find restaurants?"><p class="_0EgX2-OIShI- FN-PYpf2E6Q-">With over 60,000+ restaurants worldwide, the OpenTable website and app offer a one-stop-shop to discover and book restaurants. Search by date, time, and location to see what’s available, and then narrow down your options using filters like outdoor seating, price range or dietary restrictions.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="XDbCZTeuCPA-"><div><div class="RjGtnqKK63c- -r-aGIqyXPI- JA6p9Vj6e4U-" data-allow-multiple="true" data-test="opentable-faqs-item"><button id="faqItem-0-accordion-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqItem-0-accordion-body" type="button" class="cO0uBZWRVZk-"><h4 class="D1DFHmi9wDU- BQICRGEvJp4-">Can I read or leave a restaurant review on OpenTable?</h4><span class="irNswZTgdxU- LcVggoazFpE- MRHMDv5sa38-" data-test="icDown" data-testid="icDown"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.11 11.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708l.708-.707a.5.5 0 0 1 .707 0L12 12.414l2.475-2.475a.5.5 0 0 1 .707 0l.707.707a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .707l-3.535 3.536a.498.498 0 0 1-.708 0l-3.535-3.535Z" fill="#2D333F"/></svg></span></button><div id="faqItem-0-accordion-body" aria-labelledby="faqItem-0-accordion-title" style="max-height:0px" class="saYzDT02E6A- impression-tracked" data-index="1" data-itemid="faqItem-0" data-name="Can I read or leave a restaurant review on OpenTable?"><p class="_0EgX2-OIShI- FN-PYpf2E6Q-">Yes! Restaurant profiles feature reviews from verified diners who have actually visited the restaurant so that you know you’re getting an accurate account. And you can join in—after you dine, you’ll be prompted to leave a review of your experience.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class="_0Q58wzIacfw-" data-test="-container" data-testid="-container" style="background-color:#ffffff"><div class="_6g8Y9IcuD3E-" data-test=""><section class="-nLeajJxa6o-" data-test="internal-linking-tabs" data-testid="internal-linking-tabs"><h1 class="EeROC-R2Gxc-">Find the Perfect Restaurants Near You</h1><nav class="i0YZCrklk5g- IOgqw4a77l8-"><ol class="" role="tablist"><li class="_6h5Zq4fZJew-" data-test="tab-navigation-button" role="tab" aria-label="Most popular cities in the United States" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-tabid="Most popular cities in the United States"><span class="KNUeZiXloxY- tiodZyr3dM8-">Most popular cities in the United States</span></li><li class="" data-test="tab-navigation-button" role="tab" aria-label="Most popular global cities" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tabid="Most popular global cities"><span class="KNUeZiXloxY- tiodZyr3dM8-">Most popular global cities</span></li></ol><div class="KwWzH8AYzOY- Cab9e5IGb0g-" data-testid="tabs-overlay"></div></nav><div class="PhI21AMQFYc- xhbRm1d5DcY- _0FSHebE8kyY-"><div class="W1bxJeqeMIA-"><div class="xNkw9Yd4zNM-"><div class="RjGtnqKK63c- -r-aGIqyXPI- UhrOyr5xjSo-" data-allow-multiple="true"><button id="Los Angeles-accordion-title" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="Los Angeles-accordion-body" type="button" class="cO0uBZWRVZk-"><h4 class="D1DFHmi9wDU- BQICRGEvJp4-">Los Angeles</h4><span class="irNswZTgdxU- LcVggoazFpE- MRHMDv5sa38-" data-test="icDown" data-testid="icDown">